          "id": "jax-rs-java-api-for-restful-web-services",
          "heading": "JAX-RS (Java API for RESTful Web Services)",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Frameworks like Jersey or RESTEasy implement JAX-RS for consuming REST services."
            }
          ],
